1 original note
;A previously mistyped unit cell parameter c was was corrected from:
 _cell_length_c                   3.55986
to
 _cell_length_c                   3.566986

The crystal volume and diffraction density values were recalculated.

The new value was confirmed by looking into the original publication
and the current AMCSD entry 0012842.
;
'Saulius Gra\<zulis' 2026-09-29
